---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/equipment.css';
import checks from '../../../../../public/equipment/07-15/verification.json';
import m from '../../../../../public/equipment/07-15/interactions.json';
import {outlines} from '../../../../lib/equipment/07-15/solver.mjs';
const a='/equipment/07-15/',ref='https://www.synthecon.com/_files/ugd/0a77ca_dbd690354ebf404f9f17a5ed0db9cd79.pdf#page=1';
const display=x=>typeof x==='string'?x:Object.entries(x??{}).map(([k,v])=>k+': '+String(v)).join('; ');
---
<Layout pageTitle="Synthecon RCCS-4D documentary model" subtitle="" description="Inspect the closed documentary exterior of a Synthecon RCCS-4D and measure three separate abstract outlines." wide={true}>
<article id="rccs" class="equipment"><nav class="eq-nav"><a href="/simulations/equipment/07-15/">← Equipment 07-15</a><a href="/simulations/equipment/">Equipment register</a><a href="#rccs-checks">Verification</a></nav>
<header><p class="eq-meta">07-15 / Synthecon RCCS-4D / Closed documentary display</p><h2>Synthecon RCCS-4D</h2><p>Inspect the exterior footprint, upright body and separate nominal housing. Then use the independent outline exhibit to compare the areas of a rectangle, a notched polygon and a flat set of points. The exhibit never interacts with the instrument.</p></header>
<div class="e-grid"><section class="e-card"><h3>01 · Inspect the closed exterior</h3><div id="rccs-views" class="e-row">{['Bench','Front','Exterior','Desk'].map(k=><button type="button" data-view={k.toLowerCase()}>{k}</button>)}<button id="rccs-xr" type="button" disabled>VR unavailable</button></div><canvas id="rccs-model" aria-label="Orbitable closed Synthecon RCCS-4D exterior and separate abstract outline exhibit"></canvas><p id="rccs-asset" role="status">Loading metric GLB…</p><p class="e-hint">Drag to orbit, scroll or pinch to zoom. At the separate desk, press the white, green or gold keys to choose a rectangle, notch or flat fixture. There are no actions on the instrument.</p></section>
<section class="e-card"><h3>02 · Read an abstract area</h3><div class="e-fields"><label>Fixed outline<select id="rccs-outline">{Object.entries(outlines).map(([k,v])=><option value={k} selected={k==='notched'}>{v.label}</option>)}</select></label></div><div class="e-row"><button id="rccs-reset" type="button">Restore notched outline</button><button id="rccs-json" class="e-run" disabled>Export area JSON</button></div><p id="rccs-status" role="status">No outline read.</p><p id="rccs-result" role="status">No area read.</p><svg id="rccs-chart" viewBox="0 0 350 236" role="img" aria-label="Closed outline or collinear points on abstract axes"><path d="M58 203H303M88 23V215" stroke="#aab5ac"/><path id="rccs-shape" d="M88 203L272 203L272 134L203 134L203 42L88 42Z"/>{Array.from({length:6},(_,i)=><circle id={'rccs-marker-'+i} r="4"/>)}<text x="46" y="225" font-size="13" fill="#335564">Original geometry · abstract coordinate units</text></svg><p>The shoelace formula sums signed edge terms, then takes half the absolute value. A collinear fixture cannot enclose an area, so JSON records <code>null</code> and <code>degenerate</code>. No user points, hardware data or live samples are accepted. <a href={a+'example-area.json'}>Example JSON</a>.</p></section></div>
<section><h3>Documentary geometry</h3><div class="e-grid"><figure><img src={a+'original-front.svg'} width="760" height="450" alt="Original diagram: closed Synthecon upright base, detached casing and separate outline desk"/><figcaption>Original render. The white L-shaped base and plate proportions reference the <a href={ref}>Synthecon RCCS-4D brochure, page 1, lower right inset</a>. The separate tables and outline desk are original scene props.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src={a+'original-work.svg'} width="760" height="450" alt="Original closer view of the opaque base front and separate nominal casing"/><figcaption>Original close-up. The front cover and trim are intentionally estimated and opaque. The flat accessory housing is a dimensioned placeholder, not an appearance claim.</figcaption></figure></div>
<div class="e-over"><table><thead><tr><th>Component</th><th>Manufacturer nominal W × D × H</th><th>Parsed GLB W × D × H</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Upright base</td><td><a href={ref}>Brochure p. 1, dimensions table</a>: 203 × 210 × 229 mm</td><td>203 × 210 × 229 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Separate housing</td><td><a href={ref}>Brochure p. 1, dimensions table</a>: 241 × 241 × 114 mm</td><td>241 × 241 × 114 mm</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p>Dimensions are manufacturer nominal values, not independent measurements. No vessel is selected. The front operating area is absent; this is not a physics or biological experiment. The register’s physical behavior acceptance is not implemented.</p></section>
<section id="rccs-checks"><h3>Verification and files</h3><div class="e-over"><table><thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Expected</th><th>Actual</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>{checks.map(x=><tr><td>{x.id}</td><td>{display(x.expected)}</td><td>{display(x.actual)}</td><td>{x.pass?'Pass':'Fail'}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
<p><a href={a+'reference-plan.json'}>Predeclared cases</a> · <a href={a+'verification.json'}>Verification data</a> · <a href={a+'synthecon-rccs4d.glb'} download>Metric GLB</a> · <a href={a+'geometry-source.mjs'}>Editable geometry</a> + <a href={a+'make-model.mjs'}>generator</a> + <a href={a+'mesh-writer.mjs'}>mesh writer</a> · <a href={a+'interactions.json'}>Named targets</a>. {m.triangles.toLocaleString()} triangles and {m.draws} draw primitives; optional WebXR, headset untested.</p></section></article></Layout>
<script>import '../../../../lib/equipment/07-15/client.mjs';</script>
<style>
#rccs header{max-width:73ch;padding:1.3rem 0}#rccs h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,4rem);margin:.2rem 0}#rccs section{margin:1rem 0}.e-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}.e-card{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:.8rem;min-width:0}.e-card h3{margin:.3rem 0}.e-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem;margin:.5rem 0}.e-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.55rem}.e-fields label{display:grid;gap:.2rem}.e-fields input,#rccs button{min-width:0;min-height:2.45rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;background:var(--panel);color:var(--text);font:inherit;padding:.3rem .5rem;box-sizing:border-box}#rccs button:disabled{opacity:.52}.e-run{background:#3d596e!important;color:white!important}#rccs-model{width:100%;height:clamp(280px,34vw,440px);display:block;background:#ebe8e0;touch-action:none}#rccs-chart{width:100%;max-height:16rem}.e-over{overflow:auto}#rccs table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:.85rem}#rccs td,#rccs th{text-align:left;padding:.45rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}#rccs figure{margin:0}#rccs img{width:100%;height:auto}@media(max-width:820px){.e-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.e-fields{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
#rccs caption{text-align:left}#rccs input,#rccs select,#rccs button{min-width:0}#rccs .e-hint{font-size:.92rem}#rccs-chart{display:block;width:min(100%,36rem);height:auto;background:#edeae0}#rccs-shape{fill:#a4c2bc;stroke:#294f60;stroke-width:3}#rccs-shape.flat{fill:none;stroke:#985646}#rccs-chart circle{fill:#294f60}#rccs select{min-height:2.45rem;background:var(--panel);color:var(--text);font:inherit;border:1px solid var(--border)}</style>

